,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","color":"447744","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2024-11-25T13:03:11Z","updated_at":"2024-11-25T13:05:11Z","closed_at":"2024-11-25T13:04:48Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"- *Related to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99672.*\n\n### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.4.dev5\n- Not reproducible in: 4.3.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.dev (9e6098432) - Fedora Linux 41 (KDE Plasma) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090 (nvidia; 565.57.01) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-13900K (32 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn 4.4.dev5, I can't select multiple items in the list for opening in the Quick Open dialogs, as left-clicking any item will open it immediately:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4357c61f-e672-490e-b914-a39878432785)\n\n(This happens before you even release the mouse button, by the way.)\n\nIn comparison, in 4.3, I can select multiple items in the list by holding <kbd>Shift</kbd> or <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3dc1b535-e8fb-4b59-96b3-c00264598d2e)\n\nTo make multiple opening work again, we'll need to move opening to the mouse release event, and implement <kbd>Shift</kbd> and <kbd>Ctrl</kbd> manually in the Quick Open dialogs (as it doesn't use ItemList anymore).\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Press <kbd>Ctrl + Alt + O</kbd> (Quick Open Script) or <kbd>Alt + Shift + O</kbd> (Quick Open) in the editor.\n- Try to select multiple items by holding <kbd>Shift</kbd> or <kbd>Ctrl</kbd> and using the left mouse button in items.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot-benchmarks, but any project with several scenes/scripts will do","closed_by":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99674/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99674/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_